	<section_number>44-21</section_number>
	<catch_line>Bonds of Adjutant General and fiscal clerks</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Adjutant General and his fiscal clerks shall be bonded in accordance with § 2.2-1840.
	</text>
	<history>1930, p. 952; Michie Code 1942, § 2673(13); R. P. 1948, § 44-21; 1964, c. 227; 2011, cc. 572, 586; 2021, Sp. Sess. I, c. 152.</history>
